    "body": "<h2 id=\"h_01JMF6PK4C67V1RDD46BAKF98V\">You will learn</h2>\n<p>Learn how to see how automation messages will appear to customers as well as how to test the entire automation without turning it on. </p>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JMF6PK4CX0N107CRNCRE7TBD\">Before you begin</h2>\n<p>Please note that the preview can be slightly different than the live experience. </p>\n<p>Compared to when automations are turned on, the preview does not: </p>\n<ul>\n<li>Show shortened links</li>\n<li>Catch any typos</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JMF6PK4CSPSJSDA1R4850SKF\">Preview an individual message  </h2>\n<p>Previewing an individual message shows you how it will appear to customers: </p>\n<ol>\n<li>Click into that message. </li>\n<li>Select the <strong>Preview </strong>tab in the right sidebar. <br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/34175751790875\" width=\"624\" height=\"211\">\n</li>\n<li>Review your message. <br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/34175747467803\" width=\"624\" height=\"528\">\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JMF6PK4CQC6ZX5G6Y8GZATMB\">Walk through the automation</h2>\n<p>With automations, you also have the ability to test the entire experience. </p>\n<p>Previewing an automation is simple. </p>\n<p>To preview an automation:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Navigate to the automation. </li>\n<li>In the upper right, click the preview button.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/34175751792411\" width=\"546\" height=\"188\">\n</li>\n<li>Test the automation by typing in responses.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/34175751799707\" width=\"478\" height=\"748\">\n</li>\n<li>Once you reach a recommendation, you can restart the preview by selecting <strong>Reset Preview</strong>.<br><img src=\"https://klaviyo.zendesk.com/hc/article_attachments/34175747472667\" width=\"390\" height=\"703\">\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"h_01JMF6PK4CC4BSRJZ3EJM31YJ0\">Additional resources</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/34158785231515\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">How to create an automation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/34174623457051\">How to view an automation's analytics</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://help.klaviyo.com/hc/en-us/articles/34174737534363\">How to edit, turn off, or delete an automation</a></li>\n</ul>",
    "user_segment_ids": []
  },
